window.products.push({"id":684035,"name":"Espresso Maker 20 Bar, Compact Espresso Machine With Automatic Milk Frother, Full Stainless Steel Cappuccino and Latte Machine With 49 oz Removable Wa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LN-PUDBgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【Make Your Favorite Espresso BeveragesAt Home】: The CASABREWS coffee maker with milk frother allows you to prepare all your favorite espresso-based drinks. You can enjoy a barista-quality latte, cappuccino or macchiato at home. Stainless steel appearance, stylish and durable, ideal for any size kitchen. This compact espresso coffee maker is not only perfect for home or office use, but also makes a great wedding gift, birthday gift, christmas gift, gift for mom, gift for dad or gift for wife. ☕【Compact & User Friendly】: The small espresso machine takes up only a little space on your countertop so it is ideal for small kitchens. The 49 oz transparent water tank is detachable and easy to fill. The drip tray lifts out for easy rinsing. The brushed stainless steel is durable and a timeless design that looks beautiful in any kitchen. Included components: Espresso Machine* 1, Milk Tank*1, Water Tank*1, One-Cup Filter*1, Two-Cup Filter*1, 51mm Portafilter*1, Tamper*1, Coffee Spoon*1. ☕【Professional 20-Bar Pressure System】: Semi-Automatic 2-in-1 Espresso Maker, with 20-bar professional Italian pump and 1350W powerful motor. This latte machine gives you top quality extraction, resulting in a more fragrant and rich aroma. The built-in pressure gauge on this cappuccino machine shows the exact pressure, allowing you to adjust to your personal taste preferences. You can make cappuccinos, lattes or flat whites in your home or office with our cappuccino maker. ☕【Automatic Milk Frother】: Our espresso machine is equipped with built-in milk tank. It can be used as espresso coffee machine, cappuccino machine and latte machine. Automatic milk frother whips any milk into a light, creamy froth. Customize milk-based espresso with a simple 1 button press. Note: 1. Before making cappuccino or latte, please try purge out any residual water from milk frothing tube. 2. Run a initial self-cleaning process after making cappuccino or latte. ☕【Full Stainless Steel Design】: With full stainless steel appearance, our espresso coffee machine is more beautiful and durable than other plastic espresso machines. We also provide 1-Year Warranty. If we can be of assistance in any way, please don't hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LN-PUDBgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CASABREWS","source_asin":"B0BNPKZ79G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-684035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNPKZ79G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNPKZ79G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
