window.products.push({"id":684226,"name":"Ekelund Moomin Lucky Tree Tea Towel - Large","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mORbnN-VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OUR STORY: EKELUND MASTER WEAVERS since 1692 A family-owned business, Ekelund has been in business for over 300 years and takes pride in ensuring superior quality down to the finest thread. The company is grounded in weaving traditions yet holds a vision of becoming an environmentally sustainable production facility. Ekelund's recipe for success is the love of craftsmanship. In our weaving mill in Horred, we gather the country's foremost weavers and creators. Here we have been making woven textiles since 1692 and we have no plans to leave our proud and beautiful homestead. In short, weaving is all about pure craftsmanship, from start to finish. It's not harder than that. Ekelund’s Mission is to offer products that are right on time, we become a selectable alternative. Inspired by the Scandinavian pattern of treasure and nature, qualitative useful products are created for today's and tomorrow's consumers. We support Swedish craftsmanship tradition and make it accessible to more people, through interesting design collaborations. We keep manufacturing with modern weaving techniques at home in Horred, Sweden. We take responsibility for a sustainable future. Ekelund is a global brand with roots in Swedish design traditions. Ekelund creates inspiring designs which awaken a longing for our home every day, both now and in the future. STRONG PRODUCT OVERVIEW: Ekelund Master Weavers Kitchen towels are not only versatile and decorative but also great for everyday use in Kitchen and Dining decorations. Dry the lightest of glasses, delicate dishes, or even the worst of spills using these towels to get relief in no time. Not only that kitchen towels keep our hands clean and dry while cooking. But it can be very helpful while hosting parties, the Dishtowels come with numerous benefits in a household. A beautiful towel that will brighten your kitchen with its traditional design with care for its customer and the environment. Provides optimal coverage, absorbency, and versatile.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mORbnN-VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ekelund","source_asin":"B005I4M8NA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-684226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005I4M8NA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005I4M8NA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
