window.products.push({"id":684357,"name":"HQYXGS Massage Office Chair, Pink Gaming Chair for Adults Women Ergonomic Gaming Chair with Footrest Lumbar Support Pu Leather High Back Computer Chai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":166.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6190J1+ZSyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The office massage chair with footrest have thick pads filled with high-density shaping foam. Breathable artificial leather is durable and easy to maintain. The unique wing back design provides multiple points of physical contact to share the pressure, and protects your spine and waist through ergonomic massage support. The reclining angle of the backrest can be comfortably supported from the pelvis to the neck. ?Adjustable tilt tension control, your comfort, you control!?Adjustable Seat Height, allow you to adjust up and down to suit the height your need.?Massage Lumbar Support, powered by USB to release your waist and reduce your fatigued.?Padded Cushion & Armrests, give more support and comfort when you concentrate on working?Excellent Breathable PU Leather, wear-resisting and anti-oxidation, ensure you sit comfortably on this chair for a long time work?Durable Quiet Wheels, make no noise when you sit on or move it, away from noise issue?Heavy Duty Base, make the chair in great stability and mobilitySpecifications:Material: Breathable PU Leather, High-Resilient sponge, Nylon Casters, Durable BaseSeat Height: 17.71inch-20.86inchSeat depth: 17.71inchSeat width: 20.86inchAdjustable Seat Height: 3.15inchTotal Height: 40.5inch-43.7inchLoad Capacity: 250 lbsThe list includes:Massage chair with foot pedal: 1m5 Allen wrench: 1Screw package: 1Instruction manual: 1Pink massage office chairs are ideal choices for college students, enthusiastic gamers, and office workers who sit and work for a long time.Fashionable multifunctional office chair with massage can be used as an unforgettable birthday, Thanksgiving, Christmas or holiday gift. It can bring a healthy body and a bright smile to the one you love. For a better life, you deserve it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6190J1+ZSyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HQYXGS","source_asin":"B09BZ589WQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-684357","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BZ589WQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BZ589WQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
