window.products.push({"id":684390,"name":"Milk Frother Handheld Coffee Art Set - with Milk Frother Pitcher, Powder Cocoa Shaker, Latte Art Pen, Coffee Stencils, Coffee Spoons","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EGOqa-32L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"7 Pieces Combo Set - Nothing soothes our senses better than a cup of well-crafted coffee. It gets more interesting when you have artistic shapes forming at the top of your coffee. This combo set offers all you need to make a perfect cup of coffee. This milk frother set includes: 1 x handheld milk frother, 1 x milk frothing pitcher, 1 x powder shaker, 1 x latte art pen, 2 x coffee spoons, 1 x stainless steel coffee stencil and 16 x plastic coffee stencils. Easy to Use Coffee Art Set - Make a delicate and delicious cup of coffee like a barista - 1. Make your milk all frothy with the milk frother. Pour frothed milk into the espresso. 2. Place the stencil on top of the cup. Make sure the stencil in right position. 3. Sprinkle some cocoa powder over the espresso using the shaker. 4. Enjoy it! Frothing Milk with a Handheld Milk Frother - Comes with double spring steel head design, it helps you froth the milk in a short time, which adds a rich mouth-feel and smooth texture that elevates the latte experience at home - Need 2 x AA batteries (Not Included). The 12oz/350ml milk frothing pitcher with measurement scales inside makes it easy to read, and helps you control how much milk or cream each cup of coffee or espresso needs. Highlight Your Taste with Quality - The milk frother coffee art set mainly made from stainless steel, safe to use and easy to clean. Make latte art at home would not be expensive and would not take you much time. With this combo set, you are going to make delicate coffee like a pro, you can serve yourself, your friends and family a perfect cup of coffee at any time. Perfect Gift for Coffee Lover and No Worries About Return - This milk frother handheld coffee art set has all you need to make a delicate and delicious cup of coffee. It’s also a great gift choice for those who loves coffee. We provide the highest quality products and best customer service, please do not hesitate to let us know if you have any questions about our milk frother coffee art set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EGOqa-32L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Satu Brown","source_asin":"B07S4L2QNG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-684390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S4L2QNG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S4L2QNG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
