window.products.push({"id":684445,"name":"Cherry Blossoms Vaporwave Aesthetic Japanese Woodblock Art Pink Cool Psychedelic Trippy Hippie Decor UV Light Reactive Black Light Eco Blacklight Post","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CiYpCf5CL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Poster measures 12x18 inches (31x46 cm) and ideal size for any standard 12x18 frame. Lightweight and low-glare satin finish paper creates photo quality poster art for your home decor. All poster prints are carefully rolled and packed. UV REACTIVE INK GLOWS - Blacklight Posters are great alternatives for tapestries. Instead of fabric tapestry, elevate your home decor through optic black light as a scary and spooky Halloween horror decoration or retro groovy party art. These UV light posters are blacklight reactive for a trippy glow in the dark effect. IMPROVED EARTH FRIENDLY DESIGN - Improved eco design eliminates black velvet micro-plastic felt flocking for a more environmentally friendly non-flocked product. Eco blacklights use a pure matte black ink that offers more accurate black coverage than flocked versions for better design glow and sharpness. Eco blacklights can be easily framed or laminated. TRIPPY DECOR FOR ANY ROOM - Do you want to give your home a fresh lease on life, are a terrific way to give any room in your house a unique, energetic, and creative feel. Use blacklight reactive-UV lighting to make it glow, and the vibrant psychedelic pattern on our black light posters will come to life. Its the perfect finishing touch for your stylish room design, including your bedroom, kitchen, bathroom, and childrens room. Utagawa Hiroshige is a famous Japanese artist born as Ando Hiroshige in Japan who specialized in ukiyo-e style wood block print painting. Best know for his nature landscapes and iconic Japanese cities temples rivers and forests. A quality product 24x36 japanese posterCool gift for Dad Mom Coworker Sister Mom Dad Girlfriend Boyfriend or best friend for anniversary birthday or housewarming. A quality product. quality product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CiYpCf5CL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poster Foundry","source_asin":"B08LLGNSN1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-684445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LLGNSN1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LLGNSN1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
