window.products.push({"id":684721,"name":"U-Taste Silicone Spatula Set, 480ºF High Heat Resistant, Seamless BPA-Free Flexible Rubber Kitchen Cooking Mixing Baking Scraper for Nonstick Cookware","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61myqZslFTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Not just make it, we upgrade it.] We are a professional kitchenware producer who have been focus on customer experience. In order to offer better and eco-friendly kitchenware, U-Taste collects customer reviews of all similar products on Amazon. And then upgrade the products based on the data of the bad evaluation with the aim to provide customers with more perfect kitchenware products. [Do not melt or release odor when cooking at high temps] 17.59% reviews complaints on chemical smell, melting in hot pots, cracking after limited use. You should try our silicone spatula set with superior material. They are BPA FREE with higher heat resistance up to 480°F. They can be used to stir foods in hot skillets or pans just removed from the oven without worry about melting or other damage. Also no stains and odor after stirring sauces. [All integrated for quick & easy cleaning] You may want to get rid of removable spatula which the handle often separated from the silicone, just like 40.67% reviews display. Try this seamless set, you don't need to worry about it coming apart and crevices for germs and other gunky stuff to hide. Throw it in the dishwasher for easy clean up as 7.05% reviews want. [Soft and flexible but sturdy enough] 21.95% people had made comments that some silicone tip either too firm or too soft. U-Taste have enhanced the thickness while maintaining the right balance of strength and flexibility. Perfect for all kinds of cooking tasks, like mixing stuff and conforming to the sides of a bowl. Silicone surface also safe for your non-stick cookware. [Versatile for your all kinds of cooking needs] This 3-in-1 set includes a 11.38\" spoon spatula, a 11.38\" large spatula and a 8.94\" mini spatula. The silky smooth and non-slip grip has excellent grip (3.29% reviews like it). Long enough to keep your hand away from hot pan. Perfect for mixing, scooping and scraping. 5 vibrant colors for choice to match your kitchen decor as 9.16% reviews need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61myqZslFTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U-Taste","source_asin":"B08Y55NY42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-684721","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y55NY42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y55NY42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
