window.products.push({"id":684745,"name":"PROMOZE 15-Pack Meal Prep Plastic Microwavable Food Containers meal prepping & Lids. (24 OZ.) Black Rectangular Reusable Storage Lunch Boxes -BPA-free","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vjwsLioDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pack a healthy lunch box for you or spend days trucking across the country, you will love using these durable and reusable lunch boxes everywhere you go! 🛒 Superior Quality Meal Prep Containers to Keep you and Your Customers Happy! The leak-proof durable food boxes are the perfect dish to transport and store food in. Your amazing, mess-free delivery service will keep your customers ordering from you again and again. Features and Specifications: ◆ Large Capacity 24 Oz. – The large capacity box can store chicken, rice, and vegetables. Also great for pasta, salads, and entrees. ◆ Leak Proof Lids – Don’t you hate transporting food, and then cleaning up leaks all over your car or bags. These leak-proof food containers will take away all the hassle and make food delivery a breeze. ◆ Microwave Safe/ Dishwasher Safe on Top Rack and Freezer Safe – No freezer burns or melting, these containers can withstand temperatures from -40°F to 320°F (Or -40°C to 160 °C). ◆ Durable Construction - Made of polypropylene (#5 recyclable) strong enough to transport or store heavy foods or soups without bending or cracking. ◆ Bulk Pack of 50 Food Storage Boxes - The pack of 50 is great value for money! Spend less on more reusable freezer boxes for your home or food business. 🍱 Premium Meal Prep Boxes for Your Business!Whether you own a restaurant, food truck, deli, kiosk, catering business or pet food business these food boxes with snap on lids are the most useful food storage containers for all your needs. From warming food to freezing to stacking the take-out meals, the possibilities are endless. 🥗 Best Solution for Busy People! Diets/portion control, to-go meals and storing food ahead of time can be simple with these strong deli boxes. No more last-minute cooking. Prep your meals ahead of time, so no one goes hungry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vjwsLioDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PROMOZE","source_asin":"B0C7HKYB1R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-684745","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7HKYB1R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7HKYB1R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
