window.products.push({"id":684762,"name":"Travel Inflatable Pillow, Ultra Soft Velvet Air Neck Rest with Removable Washable Cover, Reduce Stiff Neck and Sleep Comfortably in Planes, Cars, Buse","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PbYvlzisL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Need a travel pillow that’s not a pain in the neck? With raised sides for extra support, the Tascreon inflatable is compact, lightweight & deflates in seconds to stow in carry on. A travel must-have! Adjustable, Ergonomic Support Unlike average air travel pillows (which can be hard and uncomfortable), the Tascreon travel neck rest is inflatable. Featuring innovative, contoured raised arches, you get support on both sides of your head to prevent the dreaded bobble head and help maintain proper neck alignment. Ideal for people of all ages and practically every form of travel including: airplanes cars trains buses Wash, Store, and Go In addition to being impressively soft and cozy, the micro-velvet cover is removable and machine washable, giving you a fresh pillow for every trip. When not in use, your travel headrest can be deflated in seconds, folded flat, and stored in its convenient drawstring travel sack. Multipurpose – Use It Every Day While adjustable travel pillows are primarily enjoyed on airplanes and road trips, you can use yours to make daily activities more pleasant: Binge watch your favorite TV series in comfort Maintain proper neck alignment while reading a book Avoid neck strain during long movies Take a power nap at the office Backed by a One Year Warranty If your airline travel pillow malfunctions due to a manufacturer defect within the first year, you'll receive a 100% refund. Registration Required. Add to Cart Now! Makes a great gift for frequent travelers, so give the gift of better sleep to yourself and your friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PbYvlzisL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tascreon","source_asin":"B01MF5M84N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-684762","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MF5M84N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MF5M84N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
