window.products.push({"id":684792,"name":"Sterno 10\" Cream Flameless Real Wax Pillar Candle-4-Pack Products 60146 Programmable LED Candles, 4 Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dDwJsn3+L._AC_SL1483_.jpg","description":"The Sterno products 10 inch programmable flameless pillar candle is not only safer than traditional candles, but it also eliminates mess and minimizes replacement costs since these candles don't actually burn. With this flameless pillar candle, you can easily set the mood at your restaurant, Bistro, catered event, hotel, or spa. Since it's flameless, this pillar candle is perfect for high traffic areas where regular candles can blow out. It features a classic rounded design, flat top, and attractive cream color. Convenient and cost efficient, this flameless pillar candle is the perfect way to create a comfortable, inviting atmosphere in any setting. Featuring an unscented, wax exterior and patented, realistic wick design, this product promotes a genuine candle appearance. Once turned on, the pillar has a life-like, flickering glow that gives the illusion of real candlelight and will enhance your dining area's romantic ambiance. In addition to simple on/off controls on the base, this candle features a built-in programmable timer that turns it on and off at the same time every day for convenient, maintenance-free use. It has an unprecedented run time and can stay illuminated for 1500 hours with just two c-cell batteries (sold separately). the Sterno products 10 inch programmable flameless pillar candle comes with a 1 year warranty. Sterno products delivers the most comprehensive line of portable warming, emergency illumination, butane appliances and catering products to the retail market. We share our customers' commitment to the environment and continually strive to improve our manufacturing and marketing practices to reduce our impact on the earth. Our iron-clad commitment to excellence ensures perfect performance every time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dDwJsn3+L._AC_SL1483_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sterno","source_asin":"B01N9DA2ZF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-684792","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N9DA2ZF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N9DA2ZF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
