window.products.push({"id":684837,"name":"Munzong You are My Sunshine Sunflower Throw Pillow Covers 18 x 18 Inch, Double Side Print Summer Pillowcases, Farmhouse Country Chic Square Seasonal C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pNj5BXksL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Munzong can meet you any requirement for throw pillow covers. Pillowcases are essential throughout the year. We need different pillow cases to decorate our home in different seasons and festivals. Similarly, throw pillow covers can also be given as gifts to your family and friends.  Life is a beautiful ride bicycle with fresh flowers. Sunflowers bring warmth to life. Decorate your home with you are my sunshine sunflower throw pillow covers 18 x 18 inch.  All inside edges are serged stitched to prevent fraying. The closure is zipper closure on the bottom seam so that you don't have to worry about which side is facing forward. The zipper closure also allows the pillow to poof better compared to an envelope closure. This fabric is rated for outdoor use, soft to the touch and is perfect for indoors or outdoor home decorations.It is stain and fad resistant up to 500 UV hours. Set of 4 throw pillow covers 18x18 inch: - Suitable for couch, sofa, bed, car, seat, window seat, loveseat, living room, bed room, floor, bench, office, cafe ect. - Munzong pillow covers make the perfect gift for housewarming,festival,seasonal holiday. Specification of rustic sunflower country chic throw pillow covers 18x18: - Pillow Cover Size: 18x18 inches,45x45 cm - Weight: 320g / 0.71 lbs for four pack - Hidden zipper closure - Made of Soft Cotton Linen - Vivid colors & Clear image - NO FADING, No dyes harming health of your family - 2 Sided Printed with sublimation so the design will not fade or peel. Kindly Remind: Colors May Vary on Different Screen Screen Printed Fabric Same fabric on both sides Professionally finished Insert Not Included Do not bleach Dry flat or hand to dry Package Included: 4 x Munzong rustic sunflower throw pillow covers 18x18 inch","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pNj5BXksL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Munzong","source_asin":"B089R433XC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-684837","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089R433XC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089R433XC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
